<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41124" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισυν-ᾰγωγή</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>gathering</i> or <i>being
				gathered together,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ma.</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Thess.</u>
				2.1
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>collection</i> of a sum of money, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(3).1270.11
			</span></i> (Syme, <span class="entity">ii/i B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>collective view, table,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ptol.
					<u>Tetr.</u>
					44
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> pl.,
				<i>successive additions,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Alm.</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>aggregation</i> of planets in contact, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>in Ptol.</u>
				188
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
